      "Original": "\n\n* Left click to copy name to clipboard",
      "Context": "MainInterface.DrawIcon",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "\n\n* 左键点击可将名称复制到剪贴板",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "\n(no primary dye)",
      "Context": "MainInterface.DrawIcon",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "\n（主染色为空）",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " window",
      "Context": "Commands..ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage",
      "Translated": " 窗口",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "' to clipboard.",
      "Context": "MainInterface.DrawIcon",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "」到剪贴板。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "-'New Plate' button now allows picking a folder to create the plate in",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "－点击「新建投影模板」时可指定所在文件夹。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "-Clipboard and EC imports now allow picking a folder to create the plate in",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "－从剪贴板或 Eorzea Collection 导入模板时可选择文件夹。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "-Previously, the selection process was all or nothing. It will now attempt to find a match with a valuable dye, or an item with any matching dye first",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "－之前的筛选只接受完全匹配的物品。现在会优先寻找已使用相同珍贵染剂的物品，其次选择任一染色匹配的物品。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "-TryOn/Examine dropdowns now allow picking a folder to create the plate in",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "－在「试穿」与「查看角色信息」的菜单中新建模板时也可选择文件夹。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "-You can now move plates into folders via the right-click context menu in the list",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "－可在列表中右键点击投影模板，将其移入文件夹。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Added folder selection to plate creation (thanks @firstmagic)",
      "Context": "Changelog..cctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "新建投影模板时可选择文件夹（感谢 @firstmagic）。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
